# Haunted Screen: "It becomes a 0/0 Spirit creature in addition to its other types." (CR 205.1b, 613.1d, 613.4b, 613.7). Turn 1
# Ensoul Artifact makes the Screen a 5/5 artifact creature; turn 3 Arcane Adaptation (Goblin) makes it a Goblin as well. Turn 5
# Black Lotus and five Moxen pay the {7}: the Screen is a Goblin Spirit - the Spirit added to the Goblin, not in place of it - and
# its later 0/0 overrides the Ensoul's 5/5, so the seven counters make it a 7/7.

